  40 "If you crash into a wall or a trail, your opponent scores a point. The first to reach 5 points wins.\n\nPlayer One: A / D (turn left / right)\nPlayer Two: cursor left / right\nOne player: cursor keys or A / D\nJoystick A: Player Two, joystick B: Player One\n\nSpace, fire or click: start round\nP: pause   F2: new game   Esc: abort"
